{{en-noun|-|nolinkhead=1}}

# {{lb|en|idiom|singulare tantum}} Best of the best; something [[superlative]]; the [[very]] [[best]].
#: {{ux|en|To be an astronaut you must be the '''crème de la crème'''.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|author=w:Muriel Spark|title={{w|The Prime of Miss Jean Brodie (novel)|The Prime of Miss Jean Brodie}}|year=1961|page=14|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/bwb_KR-682-713/page/14/mode/1up|passage=‘Plainly,’ said Miss Brodie, ‘you were not listening to me. If only you small girls would listen to me I would make of you the '''crème de la crème'''.’}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2024-10-08|author=Megan Uy; Tarah-Lynn Saint-Elien|title=65+ Fall Prime Day Fashion Deals Your Closet Is Begging You to Shop|journal=w:[[Cosmopolitan (magazine)|Cosmopolitan]]|url=https://www.cosmopolitan.com/style-beauty/fashion/g62529816/best-prime-day-fashion-deals-october-2024/|passage=Whether you've been on the hunt for a pair of quality overalls or you just wanna cosplay as Mrs. Robert Rausch (the ‘{{w|Love Island (American TV series)|Love Island}}’ girlies know), these ones from Dickies are the '''crème de la crème'''.}}

